gnifica ter ao redor uma excelente infraestrutura de comércio e serviços, com restaurantes, cafés, mercados e conveniências que podem ser acessados com facilidade a pé.\n\nUm imóvel para quem valoriza espaço, conforto, praticidade e uma localização verdadeiramente privilegiada.\n\nAgende sua visita e descubra de perto tudo o que este apartamento exclusivo no Edifício Natori tem a oferecer.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/edff64ea-be6e-45bd-ba8b-c7f52414b137.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/54786dd7-6efa-4397-9ce9-f301bbf1bbc4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c971706e-ef89-4672-95c3-3aaf85351e8f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/17f5f16d-c375-4bde-82f2-38be0accc4ad.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0c27abde-ef16-4484-a75b-7f7b6669dc54.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5f13f4db-6da0-40e3-9694-b9f2ca070709.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6fdcb8b2-5c19-42ed-9ffa-e795eea1d765.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/27e39bf8-121f-4e38-9aff-da855e4f1824.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0376b720-ca31-4572-8e55-a13c74e7a703.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3216b6c1-0016-4aa1-8835-9f3dd683557d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6abab2d4530811ee50343975/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b